<style>
  .freq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .freq-cell {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px) 16px;
    text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .freq-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .freq-cell.highlight {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.25);
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.25);
  }
  .freq-num { font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; color:#e5c178; line-height:1; }
  .freq-label { font-size:10px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-top:10px; line-height:1.5; }
  .freq-sub { font-size:10px; color:rgba(229,193,120,0.5); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-top:6px; }
</style>

<section style="width:100%;background:#0a0a0a;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) clamp(24px,6vw,96px);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
  <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e5c178;margin-bottom:8px;">Frecuencia</p>
  <h2 style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,52px);line-height:1;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px;">CUÁNTO NECESITAS ENTRENAR</h2>
  <p style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">Más días = mejores resultados. Pero incluso el mínimo genera cambios reales.</p>

  <div class="freq-grid">
    <div class="freq-cell">
      <p class="freq-num" style="font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,64px);">3</p>
      <p class="freq-label">Días mínimo<br/>por semana</p>
      <p class="freq-sub">Punto de partida</p>
    </div>
    <div class="freq-cell highlight">
      <p class="freq-num" style="font-size:clamp(56px,9vw,80px);">5</p>
      <p class="freq-label">Días ideales<br/>por semana</p>
      <p class="freq-sub">Máximos resultados</p>
    </div>
    <div class="freq-cell">
      <p class="freq-num" style="font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,64px);">50m</p>
      <p class="freq-label">Por sesión de<br/>entrenamiento</p>
      <p class="freq-sub">Intenso y enfocado</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
